{"type":"message","id":"9690fc96","parentId":"d74371e2","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:16:45.493Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"进度：**已确认当前本机配置文件里没有这段，需要我手动加。**\n\n但这事属于**修改系统运行配置**，而且大概率要**重载/重启 gateway** 才会生效，按我的规则我得先拿你一句明确确认再动。\n\n我建议的变更是：\n\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n\"profile\": \"full\",\n\"agentToAgent\": {\n\"enabled\": true,\n\"allow\": [\"main\", \"research\", \"execution\", \"review\", \"qa\"],\n\"maxRecursion\": 3\n}\n}\n```\n\n我会按这个流程做：\n\n1. 备份 `/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n2. 写入 `tools.agentToAgent`\n3. 校验 JSON\n4. 重启 OpenClaw gateway\n5. 做一次 agent 间通信测试\n6. 把测试结果回给你\n\n你只要回复我一句：\n\n**确认修改并重启**\n\n我就直接开干。"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773908205493}}
