{"type":"message","id":"dab619c3","parentId":"9982bc8b","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:26:36.945Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering session access**\n\nIt looks like I'm facing an issue with accessing sessions. Maybe using the sessions_spawn subagent could be a potential workaround, but the user seems to prefer direct communication among agents. I should test out the sessions_spawn runtime ACP, although it might not be relevant. Still, I believe we have made enough progress on this topic, so let's see how it unfolds moving forward!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb3311c3c81919170e883dc4de02b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpu7M0nnxry_biqy80Q3-4q_YU4RS44fKAGwc63Sk4O_BzgvW9Ztnm8Fuoxa5CDgpbJEkqinlIrjCHOGvhUIlV8NwYRF0lMFjNkiqRK4wXUbk6NPUBP_HCpkC6-kNE2jq1qOMJqC38aoBVv_cLnDuKHKz9hhIRHSU0X_bGI1Oilyd5xiHjxG7np1__yijhtWx6q72LfmrlOw7WJPTgzg6JAgGZO5jTcFLuyoNWVhtfdSkEROcghNKig2GePP-uX6R8MWLqdnEq56Eyn1pWeipPAnSfj8hNBJujYfob1U3drVXY8VqAgLPropOjGkGfyurBnoRsmHinJNu7ZnuT3xXNBEayQ9s3NWQMzz1G5-9b-1RHIzLc4GYZ9i1oZGTPdUMZrVEWly5lVWP0JgA0Lh7ge3p9_O26zRg7sUlFXpbQBO_Q0iygmv2B0Mef3wnLwG1i1wGDFZx_2Jn3ScNMZ4zcKwHKa5VH4exY8p6THTHIorpDt6xFwqWJdqTyWghf33fNuKdLEI5D_rz1aOLAYklqKGKphoXGeSBrXMjahYXdMkL38EsOW41my6sOJJy7R_tIZoEDAfRzXH58EHPIqSm8A4W1m4PUjN9HrdYDQJRPqVLZv-kEZdHcYnOUWbPm1m3oCVzWcXpUMfo-Tc2mWFjFv0v37upse6LDLiINVDJ_ncwtw_BHnNmQYTjtP-_N8Qgu0MAaO0tkBI9y6-ti2Qy_yCYpjzAA6dPOYDFqYaQrytqOOiWIH-T6yJe5aU7HlZY1IPr0joK3ly8QjCSRQ9MpkqbpKKocWn40NEDmjMvzEbb-aCN0NkN8lHuIIPOuhMSq45_Pf8hbq9WpIRwQciWgQ3GRiiu9biiKSQnTbh-LhXLVNgD_HyntUaL_WnqFjusn4liYjnfGFx71aFSjM4XzamaP9TQASAs6YhAya4XasIKY2F7uZVJGZSTygN37CdsLMB25FYH06PAJgMyq_Vc2ZVYBVkRxECvQKdBEiVFE4kn40pj_7e1SxQn8YF7cvQKDmoFvl42DckqFF4DHB_LI5N3QpEgwzRzxeunmNYoODC3ivNb2QeyhaPkf55jCdlfodfYP_bfOzd94fRiFb_vC1PYKbQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering session access**\\n\\nIt looks like I'm facing an issue with accessing sessions. Maybe using the sessions_spawn subagent could be a potential workaround, but the user seems to prefer direct communication among agents. I should test out the sessions_spawn runtime ACP, although it might not be relevant. Still, I believe we have made enough progress on this topic, so let's see how it unfolds moving forward!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 进度：\n\n- **配置已写入**\n- **Gateway 已恢复正常**\n- 当前 `openclaw.json` 里的结果是：\n\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"profile\": \"full\",\n  \"agentToAgent\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"allow\": [\"main\", \"research\", \"execution\", \"review\", \"qa\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n关键结论：\n\n1. **`agentToAgent` 确实是支持的**\n2. **`maxRecursion` 在你这版不支持**\n   - 我第一次重启失败，就是因为这个字段\n   - 去掉后已经正常起来了\n3. **服务现在是活的**\n   - `openclaw status` 能正常返回\n   - 多个 agent/account 也都还在\n\n当前状态可以概括成一句话：\n\n**agentToAgent 已经开启成功，但当前版本只能先按 `enabled + allow` 这组字段来用。**\n\n下一步我建议直接做**实测**，验证是不是真的能互发，而不是只看配置。\n\n我可以继续帮你做这两步之一：\n\n- **方案 A：做一次真实 agent 间通信测试**\n  - 例如 `main -> research` 发一条探测消息\n  - 再看 research 是否能收到 / 回传\n\n- **方案 B：继续查本地源码/文档**\n  - 把 `agentToAgent` 的实际行为、限制、调用方式彻底挖清楚\n  - 确认它是不是只影响某类工具，而不是所有 session 自动互通\n\n我建议直接走 **A，先打实测**。  \n你回我一句：**继续测试**，我就往下打。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb334d1888191b607f200cb84ce9b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":214,"output":430,"cacheRead":29952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30596,"cost":{"input":0.000535,"output":0.00645,"cacheRead":0.007488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014473}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773908783680}}
