focus on making the report concise. It might be worth suggesting the addition of tools.sessions.visibility for everyone — but then I'd need to confirm if this change is a config adjustment. The user specifically mentioned a testing scenario, so I could say it's blocked by that visibility config. It’s also a good idea to check the documentation for the exact config details, but maybe this is enough for now.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] A 方案实测结果出来了，**现在还没完全打通**。\n\n### 实测结果\n我按真实链路测了两步：\n\n1. 已找到 `research` 的真实 session\n2. 用 `sessions_send` 往 `research` 发消息时，被系统明确拦截：\n\n```text\nSession send visibility is restricted.\nSet tools.sessions.visibility=all to allow cross-agent access.\n```\n\n### 这说明什么\n结论很清楚：\n\n- `tools.agentToAgent` **已经开启成功**\n- 但**仅开这个还不够**\n- 当前真正卡住的是另一层权限：\n\n```json\ntools.sessions.visibility = \"all\"\n```\n\n也就是：\n\n**agentToAgent 负责“允许 agent 间通信能力存在”，  \nsessions.visibility 负责“是否允许跨 agent 看见并投递 session”。**\n\n### 当前判断\n你要的“多个 agent 之间直接开放通信”，至少还需要补这一项：\n\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"profile\": \"full\",\n  \"agentToAgent\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"allow\": [\"main\", \"research\", \"execution\", \"review\", \"qa\"]\n  },\n  \"sessions\": {\n    \"visibility\": \"all\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 下一步\n如果你确认，我就继续：\n\n1. 写入 `tools.sessions.visibility = \"all\"`\n2. 重启 gateway\n3. 再做一次 `main -> research` 联通测试\n4. 如果打通，再顺手测一组 `research -> execution`\n\n你回我一句：\n\n**确认继续开放 sessions.visibility**\n\n我就接着改。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb4c6df24819199c7626fa38b2fa4\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":229,"output":406,"cacheRead":34176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34811,"cost":{"input":0.0005725000000000001,"output":0.00609,"cacheRead":0.008544,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0152065}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773909186560}}
