{"type":"message","id":"7a4c77e9","parentId":"12547fd5","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:38:57.823Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Addressing user inquiries**\n\nI need to consider that the user might see my response as something an agent would relay. I think it’s important to acknowledge any duplication in the information. Maybe I should mention that this is the research agent's reply to confirm what they've conveyed. It might help clear up any confusion and show that I’m on top of the information. Keeping communication transparent is key here!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb61e06c88191925bb0c4800417ea\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpu7YhXX0IjNC7da2VymSAXmd9qwRynGPizw56_e7k_ArFiMHccVlX02jgrM1fuaB3Jqx9AraKFziDb6_yIUUuYWrH2J6qNr3ja405IHCGbB_XM2dKjTp41Rpip1Ky_nboV4VszgMB6NG76Xa4akKdMNyOEbz4-LT3SPONKBSWLlN36w-gnrE9frT0Yl4_nLveKOh5pDJ3Fbd9xwuekheSYLFM3NUBdU3BpWU131-xZ4xi8EcEunPnepdi4GnGQRujSa1DcsnikShb3iy1euwtjFdoNCRPiES8yLbQSBOxDNc8PShVdISVAlAECp-iLbwjTy1joSXzCe98xzcp0awrIdq8CYXFobCQG4Nri3aw20y4K3Tk-aBz1PeKepV5XlYacaP1WQCpj-ZXYe9f8N8JRXpks77ylsVWPy0Ys26SS8XaPUcVPoTCOpehrXU2nVDa1C01gR5ls6o_4KHRyxstpf0o-OdP_r6qyNLcKkW-i8EqRMf0w4WN5OdaYYnYJRBl6y6-KAzW3srnULtWghFvrsurbIyQFYaYVHMk2EfDWChllUAFqVaewLCXPYjB1I_qrvCN63Hlr_NkDJy41z7eeJIWhMNWFqQbdjSIBGBEzvNcw5jQYKegder6N2gcoM9vdxFWDqpv3vIu_b81szHXzjXwltI9hG_PtyYdEC6nluVyAtgDCeoNUGB2dHLEAti103DN6eBExSx54tgONO9OeB9YomVt_9oKSfaj35w4nL43UuAjPV7KeBMNKozNy5GX9bjcI2rCdEgUEdEd7rghEy0uL_Ne53XrkC6vMvk-HTjZzofHmP88pSpqDGLSqXMzdyfasCfQGCEd1v-lMJVOaHkCvjtzpKfYiciMzQ22K-eqLEOLa40hv1wl7GXvQWtlw5rTg9w2hRQJBQIYimElQdW9dcfhppggcGOgA22SrTwV_ZPrrtj0SPSMSm1Ccp7Za2Y4I-Vuaw5O6wyL369QtAi6QcuPuUWRls97ELJm-8kCaPfbPOcFvbN-UZnupMBowvaG\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Addressing user inquiries**\\n\\nI need to consider that the user might see my response as something an agent would relay. I think it’s important to acknowledge any duplication in the information. Maybe I should mention that this is the research agent's reply to confirm what they've conveyed. It might help clear up any confusion and show that I’m on top of the information. Keeping communication transparent is key here!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 对，这条就是 **research 的真实回传**。\n\n说明现在不是我本地自说自话，是真正打通了：\n\n- `main -> research` 发送成功\n- `research -> main` 回传成功\n\n结论：**agent 间直接通信已经可用。**\n\n如果你愿意，我下一步直接继续做：\n- **多跳测试**：`main -> research -> execution`\n- 或者\n- **给 5 个 agent 写协作规则**，防止互相乱聊、套娃、抢活\n\n我建议先做 **多跳测试**，把链路一次性验透。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb62144348191bf61830c90b41541\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":26314,"output":177,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37243,"cost":{"input":0.06578500000000001,"output":0.0026550000000000002,"cacheRead":0.002688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.07112800000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773909532672}}
