 is looking for an update on the status, so I should provide the information based on what’s known so far. It might be good to outline the next steps as well. I want to make sure I'm being helpful while keeping the user informed!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 当前进度：\n\n### 已确认成功\n- **配置已生效**\n  - `tools.agentToAgent.enabled = true`\n  - `tools.sessions.visibility = \"all\"`\n- **`main -> research` 已实测打通**\n- **research 的真实回传已收到**\n\n### 当前卡点\n- **`execution` 这条链路还没打通**\n- 我测了两种：\n  - `research -> execution`\n  - `main -> execution`\n- 结果都是 **timeout**\n- 查了 `execution` 的 session history，**新消息没有落进去**\n\n### 当前判断\n这说明现在不是总开关问题，而是 **execution 侧的会话可达性/激活状态** 还有问题。  \n简单说：\n\n- **research 可通信**\n- **execution 暂时不可通信**\n- 所以现在是 **部分打通，不是全打通**\n\n### 我接下来要查的\n1. `execution` 绑定是否正常\n2. 当前 `execution` 的 sessionKey 是否还是有效会话\n3. 有没有额外的 session 可见性/投递限制\n4. 必要时给 `execution` 重新造一个活跃 session 再测\n\n一句话总结：\n\n**目前 5 个 agent 互通还没完全验透，research 已通，execution 仍在排障。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb84126648191b61e52f19810e10d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":40570,"output":345,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42451,"cost":{"input":0.10142500000000002,"output":0.005175,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.10698400000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910074367}}
