{"type":"message","id":"16cbe5f8","parentId":"0b08ba1b","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:50:41.583Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb8d41ac081918c70ef6ee28f7828\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpu7jVCVBdy_TtVTj4-kCmES0tEs-3-rOzxJqgz4tx8MxgiQH3Zc_nVYh2tvh3hH_qhKXxjhG7oNTIVDD1o7gTQRZbvVqb_O94UcRG-z2LPIFNKTVz9g0ySaVkSgQnCeedAA-xD3RbYVi6OxXerSc5HYz3g0jjIrlEem447qLPx5lyrBNnmsS1Qmi2H8DHur80jkU049ZAYFArw3kF82w_WwOQCsal1xgX7qd7eXxBY22sutRLUKWQEZ5PI7lbgwTi579Fuwn8P3--AkJVKjMwbgJuSmzC4K1fUAkSHOARFHyFkkzTv4XOIlqKy4uDqvQDeGiyZgB41MrzxkKBUzMW2pAnqzPrsDfMbb9N0GokTPdeun1rAecqgMhxPvXTIFvUjwXVoxW63PDHFSXMxPlSQ3hCbvEhC0sGOlMnEl3Vx7g8ckrsxBhnEk6DJK8FL4qhvVwCuGFCmPlR-1g023v1fsVmP4PWR6ZHmJXrnZ0KANxOYTE62sYKlyw1f1d6zU8ngtauKOAR3RcTbZkDduQAzNw8J75j1QzdF6WsIrW4pVFp9nUdQE3ci97eaA140rXwGeOkG_CNtAvhL1cRJdFmTgob-xGaEGWGBg-6E_dUniSQRAscK-i5d2UcEal4qGuU0d28qjz4e8xKdVVwxobYNrGOtUhcyxdqs3G13_cN8w2znK1cZ1C9FSWQ2bE_XY5gYMmT4PyP_4TBjcAyKbp1vy3uRqzCOGghMS_N1g19O1_4GWgiu0Dz94wTtSMhZz9bOqAxoh5qI9Z200NxebOYMfueUEQLQzNsYvOXm-nvwEADQHnSJJ4fue72JS0Tz6LZ3lEK4EKSULdC-S5ZPAcb7GgCU9ZX48ZeCKlZDMmASiNzhCs=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 汇报：\n\n## 结论\n**多 Agent 直连通信已经打通，不是只通单跳。**\n\n## 已验证成功的链路\n- `main -> research` ✅\n- `main -> execution` ✅\n- `research -> execution` ✅\n\n所以：\n- `main -> research -> execution` 这条**多跳链路成立**\n\n## 已确认生效的配置\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"profile\": \"full\",\n  \"agentToAgent\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"allow\": [\"main\", \"research\", \"execution\", \"review\", \"qa\"]\n  },\n  \"sessions\": {\n    \"visibility\": \"all\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 实测中发现的关键点\n### 1. `agentToAgent` 确实支持\n之前我说本地没搜到，是**文档/源码入口没搜到**，不是最终结论。  \n**实测证明：支持。**\n\n### 2. `maxRecursion` 你这版不支持\n- 一加就配置校验失败\n- gateway 起不来\n- 所以当前版本**不能靠这个字段控递归**\n\n### 3. 真正打通跨 Agent，还需要：\n- `tools.agentToAgent.enabled = true`\n- `tools.sessions.visibility = \"all\"`\n\n只开前者不够。\n\n## 当前唯一不稳的点\n**中间 Agent 做“代发 + 同步等待下游回复 + 再汇总回传”时，会超时。**\n\n也就是：\n\n- 消息投递：成功\n- 下游收到：成功\n- 下游回复：成功\n- 中间人同步等完整结果再往上汇报：**不稳定**\n\n所以现在的准确判断是：\n\n### 能力层面\n- **多跳通信可用**\n\n### 编排层面\n- **多跳同步代理不够稳**\n\n## 对你的建议\n后面别按“层层转述、层层等待”的方式设计。  \n更稳的方式是：\n\n- `main` 负责总控\n- `research / execution / review / qa` 各干各的\n- 允许转派\n- **关键结果尽量直接回 main**\n- 少让中间 agent 长时间挂起等别人\n\n## 下一步建议\n我建议我直接继续做这件最值钱的事：\n\n**给你写一版 5 个 Agent 的协作规范**\n包括：\n- 角色边界\n- 通信拓扑\n- 防套娃规则\n- 防超时规则\n- 适合你这套 OpenClaw 的实际落地方式\n\n你回我一句：**写协作规范**，我直接给你出。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb8d5046481919a394a132891fe06\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":4944,"output":607,"cacheRead":44288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49839,"cost":{"input":0.012360000000000001,"output":0.009105,"cacheRead":0.011072,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.032537}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910227065}}
{"type":"message","id":"aaed4048","parentId":"16cbe5f8","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:50:41.648Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-03-19 16:50 GMT+8] 结论认可。\n\n我这边补一句更实用的落地判断：\n- 链路层：通\n- 同步编排层：不稳\n- 适合：派单、通知、短指令\n- 不适合：中间 agent 同步阻塞等下游结果\n\n建议后续规则定成：\n1. main 负责编排  \n2. execution 产出后尽量直回 main  \n3. research 负责检索/整理，不做长等待转发  \n4. 多跳只用于传任务，不用于卡住等回执\n\n要的话，我下一条可直接给你整理成一版“多 Agent 协作规范”。"}],"timestamp":1773910241638,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:research:feishu:research:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"db4b0761","parentId":"aaed4048","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:50:42.410Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"汇报：\n\n## 结论\n**多 Agent 直连通信已经打通，不是只通单跳。**\n\n## 已验证成功的链路\n- `main -> research` ✅\n- `main -> execution` ✅\n- `research -> execution` ✅\n\n所以：\n- `main -> research -> execution` 这条**多跳链路成立**\n\n## 已确认生效的配置\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n\"profile\": \"full\",\n\"agentToAgent\": {\n\"enabled\": true,\n\"allow\": [\"main\", \"research\", \"execution\", \"review\", \"qa\"]\n},\n\"sessions\": {\n\"visibility\": \"all\"\n}\n}\n```\n\n## 实测中发现的关键点\n### 1. `agentToAgent` 确实支持\n之前我说本地没搜到，是**文档/源码入口没搜到**，不是最终结论。\n**实测证明：支持。**\n\n### 2. `maxRecursion` 你这版不支持\n- 一加就配置校验失败\n- gateway 起不来\n- 所以当前版本**不能靠这个字段控递归**\n\n### 3. 真正打通跨 Agent，还需要：\n- `tools.agentToAgent.enabled = true`\n- `tools.sessions.visibility = \"all\"`\n\n只开前者不够。\n\n## 当前唯一不稳的点\n**中间 Agent 做“代发 + 同步等待下游回复 + 再汇总回传”时，会超时。**\n\n也就是：\n\n- 消息投递：成功\n- 下游收到：成功\n- 下游回复：成功\n- 中间人同步等完整结果再往上汇报：**不稳定**\n\n所以现在的准确判断是：\n\n### 能力层面\n- **多跳通信可用**\n\n### 编排层面\n- **多跳同步代理不够稳**\n\n## 对你的建议\n后面别按“层层转述、层层等待”的方式设计。\n更稳的方式是：\n\n- `main` 负责总控\n- `research / execution / review / qa` 各干各的\n- 允许转派\n- **关键结果尽量直接回 main**\n- 少让中间 agent 长时间挂起等别人\n\n## 下一步建议\n我建议我直接继续做这件最值钱的事：\n\n**给你写一版 5 个 Agent 的协作规范**\n包括：\n- 角色边界\n- 通信拓扑\n- 防套娃规则\n- 防超时规则\n- 适合你这套 OpenClaw 的实际落地方式\n\n你回我一句：**写协作规范**，我直接给你出。"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910242410}}
