范”**，重点包含：\n\n1. **角色边界**\n   - main / research / execution / review / qa 各负责什么\n2. **通信规则**\n   - 哪些场景允许多跳\n   - 哪些场景必须直回 main\n3. **防超时规则**\n   - 不做长等待转发\n   - 不做层层同步阻塞\n4. **防套娃规则**\n   - 避免 agent 相互递归派单\n5. **落地建议**\n   - 适合你这套 OpenClaw 配置的实际用法\n\n输出尽量短、硬、可直接执行。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb8e868a88191bc9b3132dfb092c8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":39175,"output":298,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50225,"cost":{"input":0.09793750000000001,"output":0.00447,"cacheRead":0.002688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.10509550000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910241643}}
{"type":"message","id":"fab71de5","parentId":"dd2d9c85","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:51:14.993Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-03-19 16:51 GMT+8] **多 Agent 协作规范**\n\n## 1. 角色边界\n- **main**：唯一编排者。接需求、拆任务、派单、汇总、对用户负责。\n- **research**：查资料、收集线索、提炼结论、附来源。不负责执行落地。\n- **execution**：执行具体动作。改文件、跑命令、调用工具、产出结果。\n- **review**：审结果。查遗漏、查风险、查一致性，不重新发散做新任务。\n- **qa**：做验证。测流程、测边界、复现问题、给通过/不通过结论。\n\n## 2. 通信规则\n### 允许多跳\n只允许 **任务传递型多跳**：\n- main → research → execution\n- main → review → qa\n\n适用场景：\n- research 把已明确的执行任务转给 execution\n- review 把明确的验证点转给 qa\n\n### 必须直回 main\n以下结果 **必须直回 main**：\n- 最终执行结果\n- 测试结果\n- 审核结论\n- 错误/失败/阻塞\n- 需要拍板的分歧\n\n**原则：谁产出关键结果，谁直回 main。**\n\n## 3. 防超时规则\n- **不做长等待转发**\n- **不做层层同步阻塞**\n- research / review 这类中间 agent，**只派单，不挂起等下游很久**\n- 下游 agent 完成后，**直接回 main**\n- main 再决定是否二次派给别的 agent\n\n一句话：\n**中间 agent 传任务可以，代等结果不可靠。**\n\n## 4. 防套娃规则\n- 非 main agent **默认无权继续拆多层子任务**\n- research / execution / review / qa 如需再派单，必须满足两条：\n  1. 任务边界已明确  \n  2. 只下发一跳，不继续递归\n\n禁止：\n- research → review → research\n- execution → research → execution\n- review → qa → review → qa\n- 任意 agent 把“不清楚的问题”继续甩给别的 agent\n\n**不清楚就回 main，不要横向乱转。**\n\n## 5. 落地建议\n适合这套 OpenClaw 的实际用法：\n\n1. **main 做总控**\n   - 所有用户请求先进 main\n   - main 决定派给谁\n   - 所有最终答复由 main 汇总\n\n2. **research 只做轻编排**\n   - 可把明确执行请求转给 execution\n   - 但不要同步卡住等 execution 很久\n\n3. **execution 结果直回 main**\n   - 成功、失败、日志摘要都直接回\n   - 不经 research 二次转述\n\n4. **review / qa 只做收口**\n   - review 看质量\n   - qa 做验证\n   - 结论直接给 main\n\n5. **统一失败出口**\n   - 超时\n   - 无权限\n   - 工具失败\n   - 结果不确定  \n   **一律直接回 main**\n\n---\n\n**执行版总则：**\n- **main 负责编排**\n- **子 agent 负责单点产出**\n- **关键结果直回 main**\n- **多跳只传任务，不同步等回执**\n- **不递归派单，不横向套娃**\n\n我查了记忆库，没找到现成规范记录；以上是基于这轮联通测试结论整理的可执行版。"}],"timestamp":1773910274985,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:research:feishu:research:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"5bdff404","parentId":"fab71de5","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:51:40.362Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying response direction**\n\nI think I need to respond as agent 1 to the user. The last message is inter-session updates from research with the proposed specifications. It seems I should present this to the user in a succinct way, possibly endorsing it. Since the user didn't ask anything new, but there was an inter-session message, I should rewrite it in a more standard assistant voice before sending an update.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb90a7a108191a80c293d5aeb1405\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpu7kPMu5fKtibeMqIjxLY3XmyK_kGtxrVvTcP5YnT3Kx-I6ChMIz6tuEq30sz69-6xiG3UWb_wIWWeUmxtle518QWp0J1H0OfIYZIlNkHwMkzUiKrvbO01Hq8HpZADKr_f-ZchYGKiyDEDWWVZvVKkh8B36b3Nc0MLOUi9BSyy3YwMjmPCMAaD_vMfL8r4eLYn98G5XKjlMGx7jPLputwQ_UtNi1ruvS1S14SCEnu6aECoA4pATTHMx563txWzAZ4G_11L-4vzAQhtsM-JGduWXTW8RhbOBuRXuloYOKuZzSFvJSsZ3SSvGOLf0Mk5aUMxzHXPoyYb5Zp9dunmBmSfSBSmEdUXPKXcxBE2OEl9VnoHY67lA8Y898I0tC4Zf66zjVUBHh9sY3s3X_Ba-Uj234xwcMIresrJjpsVvckWzVYP8Of7PpDRCaXSqze7vkvEjrDLvWZTzUyXxiIumRSCUv8l7YSGwwY_I2kDjwNqKR-mfkhnJfDO0lL0PPD0WSao6w1Fm6AaXhqhPdcnVtB-hsjT27xab1fC8Nyd0GwQ0LqHujWNLSa3Cbv4D3YgMOSNHk-NyenvT87yv5DnzpEM3W_dUA1y0KzEmFUKBr4biHkN0z8aXx_T-xCPloCRAy4YrfPl3X-spLFjL4x1HPNHkqaSGf1z0oX2yibmW6pkxOpd-YkC0SpG5K1fR2y74ASlTnuRHxnipfBQmXiCbvFcPe-VWDAeVpO22bOFAyp8oZBcT4t72SvEjf7X-A48wV_5K4JsvoLpGUCK7lIpsPgMFaCtUW4BILcGbrFP1SJHUjv34T1w34VI4VRlZd-2vHmWCpxg-jiYFoiN3KAD1HbPyYC-4W2_smLV8DAWWx_Tt5ay8Xhinhip5FCYShMILJgExPSaVmYi75Yc3UnpkiEj89IFulrBhJUk5GaqXH9UTfuxqel6viiIaQeH5soaFv0C5QodgTibXMeVDsrNWYFIKMtJR7Wd68Xm2Uzwji79VBZahp6OEPIdYm_38kNfnIjrKHvXfDBEtf1iUmAQHWPJ6OlwU1cApQ2PfIrLRCfOZ3A_TJD6LqC1w6mmea0H7qdQChDDUBX_Kce8HzaUbxGEpjuiE2WK_wZ-kEylnmBmtzQxELrBazBlvQhEIT9plRiL3LGIaeYrATen2UmBWcXYSuUci52vWOWq26M9yKAUG6XOj60WS3XUPseuW6AE6LGTgPH937NMwO9tj2hMOA9Q3tPqQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying response direction**\\n\\nI think I need to respond as agent 1 to the user. The last message is inter-session updates from research with the proposed specifications. It seems I should present this to the user in a succinct way, possibly endorsing it. Since the user didn't ask anything new, but there was an inter-session message, I should rewrite it in a more standard assistant voice before sending an update.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 这版可以，定稿如下，我帮你压成执行版：\n\n# 多 Agent 协作规范\n\n## 1）角色边界\n- **main**：唯一编排者。接需求、拆任务、派单、汇总、对用户负责。\n- **research**：查资料、收集线索、提炼结论、附来源。不负责执行落地。\n- **execution**：执行具体动作。改文件、跑命令、调工具、产出结果。\n- **review**：审结果。查遗漏、查风险、查一致性，不重新发散任务。\n- **qa**：做验证。测流程、测边界、复现问题，给通过/不通过结论。\n\n## 2）通信规则\n### 允许多跳\n只允许**任务传递型多跳**：\n- `main -> research -> execution`\n- `main -> review -> qa`\n\n适用场景：\n- research 把**明确的执行任务**转给 execution\n- review 把**明确的验证点**转给 qa\n\n### 必须直回 main\n以下内容**必须直接回 main**：\n- 最终执行结果\n- 测试结果\n- 审核结论\n- 错误 / 失败 / 阻塞\n- 需要拍板的分歧\n\n**原则：谁产出关键结果，谁直回 main。**\n\n## 3）防超时规则\n- 不做**长等待转发**\n- 不做**层层同步阻塞**\n- research / review 这类中间 agent，**只派单，不长时间挂起等下游**\n- 下游完成后，**直接回 main**\n- main 再决定是否继续派给别的 agent\n\n一句话：  \n**中间 agent 可以传任务，别负责同步等回执。**\n\n## 4）防套娃规则\n- 非 main agent **默认无权继续拆多层子任务**\n- research / execution / review / qa 如需再派单，必须同时满足：\n  1. 任务边界明确\n  2. 只下一跳，不继续递归\n\n禁止：\n- `research -> review -> research`\n- `execution -> research -> execution`\n- `review -> qa -> review -> qa`\n- 把“不清楚的问题”继续横向甩锅\n\n**不清楚就回 main，不要横向乱转。**\n\n## 5）落地建议\n1. **main 做总控**\n   - 所有用户请求先进 main\n   - main 决定派给谁\n   - 所有最终答复由 main 汇总\n\n2. **research 只做轻编排**\n   - 可以把明确执行请求转给 execution\n   - 不要同步卡住等 execution\n\n3. **execution 结果直回 main**\n   - 成功、失败、日志摘要都直接回\n   - 不经 research 二次转述\n\n4. **review / qa 只做收口**\n   - review 看质量\n   - qa 做验证\n   - 结论直接回 main\n\n5. **统一失败出口**\n   - 超时\n   - 无权限\n   - 工具失败\n   - 结果不确定  \n   **一律直接回 main**\n\n---\n\n## 总则\n- **main 负责编排**\n- **子 agent 负责单点产出**\n- **关键结果直回 main**\n- **多跳只传任务，不同步等回执**\n- **不递归派单，不横向套娃**\n\n这版和刚才的实测结果是对齐的，可以直接执行。  \n如果你要，我下一步可以继续做两件事里的一个：\n\n1. **把这套规范写进各 agent 的提示词/配置**\n2. **再补一轮 review / qa 链路测试**，把另一条多跳也验掉","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbb90f8514819189cefd6b399f71e1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":40221,"output":910,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51883,"cost":{"input":0.1005525,"output":0.01365,"cacheRead":0.002688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1168905}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910274988}}
