{"type":"message","id":"560d0096","parentId":"4d4178d9","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:10:45.520Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，直接测。\n\n你现在有两种测试方式：\n\n## 方式 1：我直接帮你测\n我这边可以立刻指定两个 agent 做一轮真实互发，比如：\n\n- `research -> execution`\n- `execution -> research`\n\n我会给你回：\n- 是否送达\n- 是否有回执\n- 是单向通还是双向都通\n\n如果你同意，我默认就测这两个：\n**research 和 execution**\n\n---\n\n## 方式 2：你自己在 OpenClaw 里验证\n核心前提是配置里至少有这两个：\n\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"agentToAgent\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"allow\": [\"main\", \"research\", \"execution\", \"review\", \"qa\"]\n  },\n  \"sessions\": {\n    \"visibility\": \"all\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n然后思路是：\n\n1. 找到两个 agent 的有效 session\n2. 用 `sessions_send` 从 A 发到 B\n3. 看 B 是否收到并回复\n4. 再反向从 B 发到 A\n\n---\n\n## 我建议\n最直接的验证标准是：\n\n### 单向测试\n- A -> B 成功\n\n### 双向测试\n- A -> B 成功\n- B -> A 成功\n\n### 最终结论\n- 单向可通\n- 双向可通\n- 或某一侧不通\n\n你如果要我现在直接测，我就按这个顺序来：\n\n1. `research -> execution`\n2. `execution -> research`\n\n你回我一句：**直接测**  \n我马上开干。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbd8c90f48191b12eb55345057976\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":59972,"output":355,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60327,"cost":{"input":0.14993,"output":0.005325,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.155255}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773911433568}}
