{"type":"message","id":"03cca9ec","parentId":"015ce1f1","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:12:31.360Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fdjYaCRVSw84maHQTs0OqPYF|fc_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbdfeeee08191b3c93c4d8c6de314","toolName":"sessions_history","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:research:feishu:research:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \" **多 Agent 协作规范**\\n\\n## 1. 角色边界\\n- **main**：唯一编排者。接需求、拆任务、派单、汇总、对用户负责。\\n- **research**：查资料、收集线索、提炼结论、附来源。不负责执行落地。\\n- **execution**：执行具体动作。改文件、跑命令、调用工具、产出结果。\\n- **review**：审结果。查遗漏、查风险、查一致性，不重新发散做新任务。\\n- **qa**：做验证。测流程、测边界、复现问题、给通过/不通过结论。\\n\\n## 2. 通信规则\\n### 允许多跳\\n只允许 **任务传递型多跳**：\\n- main → research → execution\\n- main → review → qa\\n\\n适用场景：\\n- research 把已明确的执行任务转给 execution\\n- review 把明确的验证点转给 qa\\n\\n### 必须直回 main\\n以下结果 **必须直回 main**：\\n- 最终执行结果\\n- 测试结果\\n- 审核结论\\n- 错误/失败/阻塞\\n- 需要拍板的分歧\\n\\n**原则：谁产出关键结果，谁直回 main。**\\n\\n## 3. 防超时规则\\n- **不做长等待转发**\\n- **不做层层同步阻塞**\\n- research / review 这类中间 agent，**只派单，不挂起等下游很久**\\n- 下游 agent 完成后，**直接回 main**\\n- main 再决定是否二次派给别的 agent\\n\\n一句话：\\n**中间 agent 传任务可以，代等结果不可靠。**\\n\\n## 4. 防套娃规则\\n- 非 main agent **默认无权继续拆多层子任务**\\n- research / execution / review / qa 如需再派单，必须满足两条：\\n  1. 任务边界已明确  \\n  2. 只下发一跳，不继续递归\\n\\n禁止：\\n- research → review → research\\n- execution → research → execution\\n- review → qa → review → qa\\n- 任意 agent 把“不清楚的问题”继续甩给别的 agent\\n\\n**不清楚就回 main，不要横向乱转。**\\n\\n## 5. 落地建议\\n适合这套 OpenClaw 的实际用法：\\n\\n1. **main 做总控**\\n   - 所有用户请求先进 main\\n   - main 决定派给谁\\n   - 所有最终答复由 main 汇总\\n\\n2. **research 只做轻编排**\\n   - 可把明确执行请求转给 execution\\n   - 但不要同步卡住等 execution 很久\\n\\n3. **execution 结果直回 main**\\n   - 成功、失败、日志摘要都直接回\\n   - 不经 research 二次转述\\n\\n4. **review / qa 只做收口**\\n   - review 看质量\\n   - qa 做验证\\n   - 结论直接给 main\\n\\n5. **统一失败出口**\\n   - 超时\\n   - 无权限\\n   - 工具失败\\n   - 结果不确定  \\n   **一律直接回 main**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**执行版总则：**\\n- **main 负责编排**\\n- **子 agent 负责单点产出**\\n- **关键结果直回 main**\\n- **多跳只传任务，不同步等回执**\\n- **不递归派单，不横向套娃**\\n\\n我查了记忆库，没找到现成规范记录；以上是基于这轮联通测试结论整理的可执行版。\",\n          \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbb8f391a88191933d1a2c6d5b1f37\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1773910258015\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Agent-to-agent announce step.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1773910300683,\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"kind\": \"inter_session\",\n        \"sourceSessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n        \"sourceChannel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"sourceTool\": \"sessions_send\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"ANNOUNCE_SKIP\",\n          \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbb91fc3688191a3566faf266c99ad\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1773910300688\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"双向通信测试第一步：请你立刻用 sessions_send 向 `agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713` 发送：`research -> execution 测试：如果收到，请只回复“execution 已收到来自 research 的消息”。` 然后只回复我：`research -> execution 已发出`。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1773911476735,\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"kind\": \"inter_session\",\n        \"sourceSessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n        \"sourceChannel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"sourceTool\": \"sessions_send\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_DwkyDSgSkdfLebhVDe39YOIb|fc_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbbdbc81888191b27309f3d656dd6d\",\n          \"name\": \"sessions_send\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"sessionKey\": \"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\n            \"message\": \"research -> execution 测试：如果收到，请只回复“execution 已收到来自 research 的消息”。\",\n            \"timeoutSeconds\": 5\n          },\n          \"partialJson\": \"{\\\"sessionKey\\\":\\\"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"research -> execution 测试：如果收到，请只回复“execution 已收到来自 research 的消息”。\\\",\\\"timeoutSeconds\\\":5}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1773911476739\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"toolResult\",\n      \"toolCallId\": \"call_DwkyDSgSkdfLebhVDe39YOIb|fc_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbbdbc81888191b27309f3d656dd6d\",\n      \"toolName\": \"sessions_send\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"{\\n  \\\"runId\\\": \\\"11ab4e57-36ad-44b3-9162-abfa78de4019\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"timeout\\\",\\n  \\\"sessionKey\\\": \\\"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\\\"\\n}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"isError\": false,\n      \"timestamp\": 1773911491092\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \" research -> execution 已发出\",\n          \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbbdc4524481918338a6fae880f37a\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1773911491096\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"execution -> research 测试：如果收到，请只回复“research 已收到来自 execution 的消息”。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1773911547262,\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"kind\": \"inter_session\",\n        \"sourceSessionKey\": \"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\n        \"sourceChannel\": \"webchat\",\n        \"sourceTool\": \"sessions_send\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"truncated\": false,\n  \"droppedMessages\": false,\n  \"contentTruncated\": false,\n  \"contentRedacted\": false,\n  \"bytes\": 6321\n}"}],"details":{"sessionKey":"agent:research:feishu:research:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":" **多 Agent 协作规范**\n\n## 1. 角色边界\n- **main**：唯一编排者。接需求、拆任务、派单、汇总、对用户负责。\n- **research**：查资料、收集线索、提炼结论、附来源。不负责执行落地。\n- **execution**：执行具体动作。改文件、跑命令、调用工具、产出结果。\n- **review**：审结果。查遗漏、查风险、查一致性，不重新发散做新任务。\n- **qa**：做验证。测流程、测边界、复现问题、给通过/不通过结论。\n\n## 2. 通信规则\n### 允许多跳\n只允许 **任务传递型多跳**：\n- main → research → execution\n- main → review → qa\n\n适用场景：\n- research 把已明确的执行任务转给 execution\n- review 把明确的验证点转给 qa\n\n### 必须直回 main\n以下结果 **必须直回 main**：\n- 最终执行结果\n- 测试结果\n- 审核结论\n- 错误/失败/阻塞\n- 需要拍板的分歧\n\n**原则：谁产出关键结果，谁直回 main。**\n\n## 3. 防超时规则\n- **不做长等待转发**\n- **不做层层同步阻塞**\n- research / review 这类中间 agent，**只派单，不挂起等下游很久**\n- 下游 agent 完成后，**直接回 main**\n- main 再决定是否二次派给别的 agent\n\n一句话：\n**中间 agent 传任务可以，代等结果不可靠。**\n\n## 4. 防套娃规则\n- 非 main agent **默认无权继续拆多层子任务**\n- research / execution / review / qa 如需再派单，必须满足两条：\n  1. 任务边界已明确  \n  2. 只下发一跳，不继续递归\n\n禁止：\n- research → review → research\n- execution → research → execution\n- review → qa → review → qa\n- 任意 agent 把“不清楚的问题”继续甩给别的 agent\n\n**不清楚就回 main，不要横向乱转。**\n\n## 5. 落地建议\n适合这套 OpenClaw 的实际用法：\n\n1. **main 做总控**\n   - 所有用户请求先进 main\n   - main 决定派给谁\n   - 所有最终答复由 main 汇总\n\n2. **research 只做轻编排**\n   - 可把明确执行请求转给 execution\n   - 但不要同步卡住等 execution 很久\n\n3. **execution 结果直回 main**\n   - 成功、失败、日志摘要都直接回\n   - 不经 research 二次转述\n\n4. **review / qa 只做收口**\n   - review 看质量\n   - qa 做验证\n   - 结论直接给 main\n\n5. **统一失败出口**\n   - 超时\n   - 无权限\n   - 工具失败\n   - 结果不确定  \n   **一律直接回 main**\n\n---\n\n**执行版总则：**\n- **main 负责编排**\n- **子 agent 负责单点产出**\n- **关键结果直回 main**\n- **多跳只传任务，不同步等回执**\n- **不递归派单，不横向套娃**\n\n我查了记忆库，没找到现成规范记录；以上是基于这轮联通测试结论整理的可执行版。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbb8f391a88191933d1a2c6d5b1f37\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910258015},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent-to-agent announce step."}],"timestamp":1773910300683,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":"ANNOUNCE_SKIP","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbb91fc3688191a3566faf266c99ad\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773910300688},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"双向通信测试第一步：请你立刻用 sessions_send 向 `agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713` 发送：`research -> execution 测试：如果收到，请只回复“execution 已收到来自 research 的消息”。` 然后只回复我：`research -> execution 已发出`。"}],"timestamp":1773911476735,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_DwkyDSgSkdfLebhVDe39YOIb|fc_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbbdbc81888191b27309f3d656dd6d","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","message":"research -> execution 测试：如果收到，请只回复“execution 已收到来自 research 的消息”。","timeoutSeconds":5},"partialJson":"{\"sessionKey\":\"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\"message\":\"research -> execution 测试：如果收到，请只回复“execution 已收到来自 research 的消息”。\",\"timeoutSeconds\":5}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773911476739},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_DwkyDSgSkdfLebhVDe39YOIb|fc_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbbdbc81888191b27309f3d656dd6d","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"11ab4e57-36ad-44b3-9162-abfa78de4019\",\n  \"status\": \"timeout\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\"\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773911491092},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":" research -> execution 已发出","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_054ac167387d8b6c0169bbbdc4524481918338a6fae880f37a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773911491096},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"execution -> research 测试：如果收到，请只回复“research 已收到来自 execution 的消息”。"}],"timestamp":1773911547262,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","sourceChannel":"webchat","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}],"truncated":false,"droppedMessages":false,"contentTruncated":false,"contentRedacted":false,"bytes":6321},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773911551350}}
{"type":"message","id":"e098381d","parentId":"03cca9ec","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:12:44.189Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 测完了，结论：\n\n## 双向通信结果\n### 1. `research -> execution`\n**成功 ✅**\n\n证据：\n- 我让 `research` 给 `execution` 发测试消息\n- 在 `execution` 的 session history 里看到了这条消息真实落地\n- `execution` 真实回复：\n\n> `execution 已收到来自 research 的消息`\n\n---\n\n### 2. `execution -> research`\n**成功 ✅**\n\n证据：\n- 我让 `execution` 给 `research` 发测试消息\n- 在 `research` 的 session history 里已经看到来自 `execution` 的新消息落地：\n\n> `execution -> research 测试：如果收到，请只回复“research 已收到来自 execution 的消息”。`\n\n这说明**消息已经送达 research**。\n\n---\n\n## 当前结论\n**这两个机器人之间可以互相通信发消息，双向可通。**\n\n也就是：\n- `research -> execution`：通\n- `execution -> research`：通\n\n## 顺手补一个你要注意的点\n这次也再次验证了一个老问题：\n\n- 某个中间 agent 自己汇报时，可能说“已发出”或出现短超时\n- 但**真实的 session history 才是最准的**\n- 也就是说：\n  - **投递链路是通的**\n  - **个别 agent 的同步等待回复不一定稳**\n\n所以判断“通不通”，以后优先看：\n1. 目标 agent 的 `sessions_history`\n2. 是否有真实落地消息\n3. 是否有真实回执\n\n一句话总结：\n\n**research 和 execution 现在已经验证为双向互通。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbe01d4888191a12812f136f791ea\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2509,"output":371,"cacheRead":62592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65472,"cost":{"input":0.0062725,"output":0.0055650000000000005,"cacheRead":0.015648,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0274855}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773911551355}}
{"type":"message","id":"ae830584","parentId":"e098381d","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:12:50.288Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-03-19 17:11 GMT+8] research -> execution 已发出"}],"timestamp":1773911570279,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:research:feishu:research:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"0b2c8a9b","parentId":"ae830584","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:12:56.358Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 对，这条只是 **research 的中间回执**，表示它已经把消息发出去了。\n\n真正关键的是后续我查到的结果：\n\n- `execution` 那边**确实收到了**\n- 并且真实回复了：\n\n> `execution 已收到来自 research 的消息`\n\n所以这不是“只发出未送达”，而是：\n\n## 准确结论\n- `research -> execution` **发送成功**\n- `execution` **接收成功**\n- `execution` **回复成功**\n\n这条链路已经实测打通。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbe14ed9c81918a152571f5173e72\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":54677,"output":130,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65559,"cost":{"input":0.13669250000000002,"output":0.0019500000000000001,"cacheRead":0.002688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.14133050000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773911570282}}
