{"type":"message","id":"b2a22027","parentId":"3414db9a","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:13:02.867Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 这条也说明 **execution 当前会话是活的**，可以正常收发。\n\n结合刚才整轮测试，现在结论可以定死：\n\n## 两机器人互发测试结果\n- `research -> execution`：**通**\n- `execution -> research`：**通**\n\n### 所以最终结论\n**这两个机器人之间已经验证为双向互通，可以互相通信发消息。**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续帮你做两个实用动作之一：\n\n1. **再测另外一对**\n   - 比如 `review <-> qa`\n\n2. **给你整理一份“机器人互通测试 SOP”**\n   - 以后你自己照着测任意两个 agent\n   - 一套固定步骤，3 分钟出结果\n\n我建议第 2 个更值钱。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbe1b3138819191b51f1135303465\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":64099,"output":186,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65821,"cost":{"input":0.16024750000000001,"output":0.00279,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1634215}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773911576452}}
