ked about whether experience matters for us, so I could definitely use my summarizing skills here. I can apply my summarizing capabilities to get the essence of the article. I just need to ensure I scan my skills correctly to see if summarizing is the best approach in this context. Let's get started!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先把这个 HTML 内容读出来，快速判断哪些经验对我们这套 OpenClaw 真有用。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbe55b2ec8191ac6c890a6560d289\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Ssd1P2ycYCsmOhxdz5C2qgjQ|fc_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbe55c42481919395cd3eaa7863ca","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/summarize/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/summarize/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":540,"output":108,"cacheRead":66560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67208,"cost":{"input":0.00135,"output":0.0016200000000000001,"cacheRead":0.01664,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01961}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773911626003}}
{"type":"message","id":"dddb1304","parentId":"e1bbf743","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:13:58.296Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ssd1P2ycYCsmOhxdz5C2qgjQ|fc_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbe55c42481919395cd3eaa7863ca","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: summarize\ndescription: Summarize URLs or files with the summarize CLI (web, PDFs, images, audio, YouTube).\nhomepage: https://summarize.sh\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🧾\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"summarize\"]},\"install\":[{\"id\":\"brew\",\"kind\":\"brew\",\"formula\":\"steipete/tap/summarize\",\"bins\":[\"summarize\"],\"label\":\"Install summarize (brew)\"}]}}\n---\n\n# Summarize\n\nFast CLI to summarize URLs, local files, and YouTube links.\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nsummarize \"https://example.com\" --model google/gemini-3-flash-preview\nsummarize \"/path/to/file.pdf\" --model google/gemini-3-flash-preview\nsummarize \"https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ\" --youtube auto\n```\n\n## Model + keys\n\nSet the API key for your chosen provider:\n- OpenAI: `OPENAI_API_KEY`\n- Anthropic: `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`\n- xAI: `XAI_API_KEY`\n- Google: `GEMINI_API_KEY` (aliases: `GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY`, `GOOGLE_API_KEY`)\n\nDefault model is `google/gemini-3-flash-preview` if none is set.\n\n## Useful flags\n\n- `--length short|medium|long|xl|xxl|<chars>`\n- `--max-output-tokens <count>`\n- `--extract-only` (URLs only)\n- `--json` (machine readable)\n- `--firecrawl auto|off|always` (fallback extraction)\n- `--youtube auto` (Apify fallback if `APIFY_API_TOKEN` set)\n\n## Config\n\nOptional config file: `~/.summarize/config.json`\n\n```json\n{ \"model\": \"openai/gpt-5.2\" }\n```\n\nOptional services:\n- `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY` for blocked sites\n- `APIFY_API_TOKEN` for YouTube fallback\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773911638283}}
