{"type":"message","id":"d7a45cd0","parentId":"ba4bc449","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:18:18.159Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning file operations**\n\nI need to perform some file operations and possibly ask questions along the way. I want to check the existing directories for the agents and see if I can find any skills. I might need to update multiple files, so knowing the paths from the configuration will be helpful, likely related to agent workspaces. I think creating an AGENTS.md file in each workspace could be a good idea to keep things organized. Let's keep it concise!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbf538b7c8191a0f5175cd4deb4b9\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpu79YmCAxJOej1GrxYxQ6Ih9QE2WG11wAaCaU7VyvnRzbYPL9G6jx5D5P0DKwyCW4V9Tvp7NzVRZDFB3GIXxgfUL1NDl3zERxiih6pvflmiO1pDfiMV70124wNVzNKe68zFFWE_3eOj_wiP05Sask5uPlKQDXKrDNj-ISRqnp4Q7_d73xXhKX12RuD6LYR9dCJHxjLyrvEGM47GifKukTvV85juOO_tkNZeMt6-NUJxDZNnNwkFCzMDQFVql89CyGiv1OW8yOHR_nTk-nTsRIpR61rgdE-DSB8DiN3iXcdXUPzRquxzu4Z0ARwjUD7TH2YY5U_zz-lC36iYg8n51aBknTdA6I4sM3Wzl5Vz6n2MFhLdYMkCMYISLA-pJRAnzBeki-ojjaY04t2eP1u01yqXu0pSsBwXLN3ljHlwZb4XgCLdPPbrwt2COeLxQOmu7BXfuJPDFus4cw3P5NgAe6tWYHt_L2UmteAHup8twNefiTC5ooDgv0NOZdtwSFVoSvXaJ8WrlIAmVVwr8JqCRzPJQ9rZy5ln8C3TEsn6vF9pCb8FgDVEFycQ-_yRra3aUEYCR4x7PTjl01blWsOsl_kRmLhwHgKlHIyuksskU4xH9zjyNsuM_wIembZ9eo8qS6aZPDR6C2jv-4zkmSy7csYzRTzwl3c0Sx1zQtWaP0rlAOpTxM2RuXEBWRGeQTiOi7BkC01SzPWmCkOHyer3EhwpwpbwKiENhZIOO8wOrbUhvsxsdMfCHmgqH7yrhZU0Xb605rkBWnh46c8Q8864FiHhnBvxNmuKqxREnzSI-Cqo3-dKqOqwUMfnDi0XbygqXHdfIgc02lgTs5iflS-HfJKliNZvxRXoZwXiY3zioBTfdaJO1vV22Bv8LDjEXWY4FB6zKIjkipRQe4Fhx5TjcJXLLb6pEm1Tj7OYnheR0ZPlS7ti4-tEPSQhpqyAo7OpNI32QA4mcqLGSOeudTv8TpIGm9Jg3-GqtDN4FNspI_JlI5JQ9O8NRye1huvr2ey-AlqDUmKCfzprlMr0iwXwYYppvSnrrLxLG-X0KmIR7hzL7oRrWrFpBFAjCIStpIth409gW7_WWIcRdI0ho3jMYO3p1sBs7YTWaVJRrIztoCu1EuKb0tU_JQIZ83acqyZI25ksk3efv-aC6qKbKPN36PzJOvurMZTR0KIj6uY7XbQDd0MYdyhmjmgF85dFV9vjVoT4ih\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning file operations**\\n\\nI need to perform some file operations and possibly ask questions along the way. I want to check the existing directories for the agents and see if I can find any skills. I might need to update multiple files, so knowing the paths from the configuration will be helpful, likely related to agent workspaces. I think creating an AGENTS.md file in each workspace could be a good idea to keep things organized. Let's keep it concise!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我直接给现有 5 个 agent 的 workspace 都写一份 `AGENTS.md`，内容统一成可执行版，重点告诉它们：**谁是谁、什么场景联系谁、怎么联系、什么情况下别乱转。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbf589b2c8191b9ef23914addc498\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ugfEU5Ji2e5hc030XeiC6e3H|fc_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbf58afc88191990083b46d367482","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"set -e\nfor d in /root/.openclaw/workspace /root/.openclaw/workspaces/research /root/.openclaw/workspaces/execution /root/.openclaw/workspaces/review /root/.openclaw/workspaces/qa; do\n  mkdir -p \"$d\"\ndone\nprintf '%s\n' /root/.openclaw/workspace /root/.openclaw/workspaces/research /root/.openclaw/workspaces/execution /root/.openclaw/workspaces/review /root/.openclaw/workspaces/qa","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"set -e\\nfor d in /root/.openclaw/workspace /root/.openclaw/workspaces/research /root/.openclaw/workspaces/execution /root/.openclaw/workspaces/review /root/.openclaw/workspaces/qa; do\\n  mkdir -p \\\"$d\\\"\\ndone\\nprintf '%s\\n' /root/.openclaw/workspace /root/.openclaw/workspaces/research /root/.openclaw/workspaces/execution /root/.openclaw/workspaces/review /root/.openclaw/workspaces/qa\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8730,"output":283,"cacheRead":66944,"cache