{"type":"message","id":"90e9ea31","parentId":"6fa56ac9","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:19:30.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已写好，5 个 agent 的 `AGENTS.md` 都落了。\n\n## 已写入位置\n- `main` → `/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md`\n- `research` → `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/research/AGENTS.md`\n- `execution` → `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/execution/AGENTS.md`\n- `review` → `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/review/AGENTS.md`\n- `qa` → `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/qa/AGENTS.md`\n\n## 里面写了什么\n每份都包含了：\n- 团队成员是谁\n- 各自职责\n- 什么场景联系谁\n- 如何联系其他 agent\n- `sessions_send` 可用的 `sessionKey`\n- 什么情况下**必须直接回 main**\n- 防乱转 / 防套娃规则\n- 推荐回报格式\n\n## 关键点\n我这次不是写成空泛介绍，而是按**今天实测出来的真实工作方式**写的：\n\n- 可跨 agent 发消息\n- 联系方式用 `sessions_send`\n- 以 `sessionKey` 为准\n- 多跳只传任务\n- 关键结果直回 `main`\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续帮你做一个更狠的版本：\n\n**把这些规则同步写进每个 agent 的 `SOUL.md` 或 system prompt 里**\n\n那样不是“知道怎么联系”，而是“行为上更容易真的这么做”。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbbf9c151481918d18c14333c75cfd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":201,"output":335,"cacheRead":79232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79768,"cost":{"input":0.0005025,"output":0.005025,"cacheRead":0.019808,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0253355}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773911960003}}
