{"type":"message","id":"9f199ebb","parentId":"6f71e20f","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:31:29.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已写好，文件在：\n\n`/root/.openclaw/workspace/多agent配置文档.md`\n\n这份文档已经把两部分融合进去了：\n\n- **外部文章里有价值的经验**\n- **我们今天本机实测出来的真实结论、坑点、修正项**\n\n重点我已经帮你补上了几个文章没讲透的地方：\n\n- `agentToAgent` 不是单独开就够\n- 还要加 `tools.sessions.visibility = \"all\"`\n- `maxRecursion` 当前版本不支持\n- 多跳链路能通，但中间 agent 同步等回执不稳\n- `sessions_send` 实操更稳的是用 `sessionKey`\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续直接做这两个动作之一：\n\n1. **把这份 md 文件发给你**\n2. **再压缩成一个对外分享版**，更短、更像教程\n\n你要的话我就直接发。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbc26da5e481919c9b6ce000c9d999\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2298,"output":220,"cacheRead":81408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83926,"cost":{"input":0.005745,"output":0.0033,"cacheRead":0.020352,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029397}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773912679805}}
