{"type":"message","id":"82f4d0a2","parentId":"23d56be6","timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:34:14.911Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已结合完成，我新生成了一版融合文档：\n\n`/root/.openclaw/workspace/多agent配置文档_融合版.md`\n\n这版比前一版更完整，额外补进了你刚发那份里的几个关键点：\n\n- **主机器人必须纳入 `accounts.default`**\n- **Feishu 必须整理成纯 `accounts` 多账号结构**\n- **必须显式开启 `session.dmScope = per-account-channel-peer`**\n- **群里必须 `@` 才响应**\n- **bindings / workspace / agentDir / 路由 / 验证步骤** 全补齐了\n- 同时保留了我们今天实测出来的修正项：\n  - `agentToAgent` 还不够，得加 `sessions.visibility = all`\n  - `maxRecursion` 当前版本不支持\n  - 链路层通，但同步编排层不稳\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接：\n\n1. **把这份融合版文件发给你**\n2. **再继续压缩成一版对外分享版教程**\n\n你要我发的话，我直接发。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bbc31222b08191a7afbadaef892a68\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":226,"output":255,"cacheRead":90624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91105,"cost":{"input":0.0005650000000000001,"output":0.0038250000000000003,"cacheRead":0.022656,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027046}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773912845698}}
