{"type":"message","id":"12ff9c47","parentId":"91e7ce48","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:02:51.224Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 记好了。\n\n以后你只要说类似这种话：\n\n- 新增一个 content agent\n- 加一个运营机器人\n- 再建一个 iOS 开发 agent\n\n我就会默认按这套流程走：\n\n1. 自动调用初始化脚本  \n   `scripts/init-agent.py`\n2. 自动补：\n   - workspace\n   - `AGENTS.md`\n   - `SOUL.md`\n   - `agents.list`\n   - `bindings`\n   - `tools.agentToAgent.allow`\n3. 再提醒你补 Feishu 账号配置\n4. 最后重启并做联通测试\n\n我也已经把这条记进长期记忆了。  \n以后不用你重复解释。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02a49797e73cc2790169bc0207c47c8191936d5a73af425e95\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":204,"output":159,"cacheRead":152832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":153195,"cost":{"input":0.00051,"output":0.002385,"cacheRead":0.038208,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.041103}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773928966372}}
